OL,3,GNEWSAFormer nuclear bunker now home to
OL,4,Amore than a million government files
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn old nuclear bunker in the suburbs of
OL,7,Fsouth Belfast is now protecting
OL,8,Fpaperwork rather than people.
OL,10,FBuilt in 1953 at the start of the Cold
OL,11,FWar, its windowless rooms are now home
OL,12,Fto more than a million government
OL,13,Fpictures and files.
OL,15,FThe historic environment records are
OL,16,Fbeing stored in what used to be an
OL,17,Femergency hub in case of a nuclear
OL,18,Fbomb.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
